{"id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","title":"Signed and Complex Integral Values","display":"df-signed-integral-data — Signed and Complex Integral Values","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-signed-integral-data","aliases":["58-df-signed-integral-data"],"display":"df-signed-integral-data — Signed and Complex Integral Values","depends_on":["[[58-df-integral.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-signed-integral-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-signed-integral-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signed-integral-data — Signed and Complex Integral Values"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral.md\">58-df-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"436d98ae01957594\" href=\"?note=436d98ae01957594\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,z,r\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,z,r\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\{(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\land a&lt;b\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\{(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\land a&lt;b\\})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}(\\{[0,a):a&gt;0\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\infty]:a\\geq0\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_+=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}(\\{[0,a):a&gt;0\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\infty]:a\\geq0\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re},\\operatorname{Im}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(\\operatorname{Re},\\operatorname{Im}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 是标准复数的两个实坐标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_+,f_-,|f|\">\\(f_+,f_-,|f|\\)</span> 在本文件仅按下面的函数图缩写。非负积分和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot\">\\(\\odot\\)</span> 来自 <code>58-df-integral</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 的二元积使用有序对编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(f(x,y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(x,y)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\">\\(f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(x,y)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(x,y)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(x,y)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"436d98ae01957594\" href=\"?note=436d98ae01957594\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land r=\\int_X f\\,d\\mu.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land r=\\int_X f\\,d\\mu.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r_+,r_-\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_+,\\{\\langle x,\\max(f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_-,\\{\\langle x,\\max(-f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land r=r_+-r_-\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r_+,r_-\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_+,\\{\\langle x,\\max(f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_-,\\{\\langle x,\\max(-f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land r=r_+-r_-\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S(z,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land z\\in\\mathbb C\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Re}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(b,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Im}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land z=a+ib\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S(z,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land z\\in\\mathbb C\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Re}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(b,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Im}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land z=a+ib\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\n(\\Sigma,\\{A\\times B:A\\in\\mathcal A\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\},X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\odot\\nu(B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\n(\\Sigma,\\{A\\times B:A\\in\\mathcal A\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\},X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\odot\\nu(B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有符号积分只在正、负部分均有限时取实数值；非负积分可以为无穷。二元积测度不加入概率归一化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"436d98ae01957594","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measure}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"436d98ae01957594","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,z,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\{(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\land a<b\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_+=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}(\\{[0,a):a>0\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\infty]:a\\geq0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Re},\\operatorname{Im}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"f_+,f_-,|f|","display":false},{"tex":"\\odot","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f(x,y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(x,y)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(x,y)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land r=\\int_X f\\,d\\mu.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r_+,r_-\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_+,\\{\\langle x,\\max(f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r_-,\\{\\langle x,\\max(-f(x),0)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land r=r_+-r_-\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S(z,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land z\\in\\mathbb C\n\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(a,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Re}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(b,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{Im}(f(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land z=a+ib\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\n(\\Sigma,\\{A\\times B:A\\in\\mathcal A\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\},X\\times Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\odot\\nu(B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3698,"backlinks":[{"id":"857c580ef52511af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$、$\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}$ 取 [[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"e22e6b1080a66235","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}$ 取 [[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"70a18be302d94faf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bda18e5a40f416fb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}$ 取 [[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cd614fd2298b74e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"43b99c61f80582d8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"83e0b1063552231c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}$ 为标准实数 Borel 集族；非负积分值采用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]。对 $a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n$，$[a,b]_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)\\le x(i)\\le b(i))\\}$。"},{"id":"d4fc4686aaece886","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的扩展非负实数 Borel 结构；$\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非负积分。"},{"id":"5164bda26b0e7924","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]；$\\exp$ 使用 [[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]。"},{"id":"34f1c7d95297d4b7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$、$\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"d47484adcb88c697","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md|58-df-signed-integral-data]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["4884f45058a56aac","bbbec05fde1d3b01","436d98ae01957594","e03c77e7d23896d9","36d7463d215be751","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}